      "content": "The Chief Financial Officers Council itself does not operate a developer API. This\nbest-effort OpenAPI documents a subset of the USAspending.gov v2 API operated by the\nU.S. Department of the Treasury, which is the primary federal financial-management\ndata API closely associated with the CFOC remit. Source: https://api.usaspending.gov/docs/endpoints.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: USAspending.gov",
